Body:
📋 TEMPLATE · deep dive on one HS- system — the featured system cannot be invented; pick it when the slot arrives.
FILL CHECKLIST (~20 min): 1. Choose the HS- system with Vincent · 2. Fill every {{ token }} with its real spec · 3. Pull an early-wearer quote from Proof Bank if one exists · 4. Verify links/UTMs · 5. Test · 6. Schedule.

[Text - Masthead]
Hair Solutions Co. — Spotlight

[Hero - Photo-led]
{{ image: the featured system, hero shot }}

[Text - Opening]
Hi {{ firstname }},

Usually we cover the range. This time, one system — {{ system name }} — and a proper look at it: what it does well, what it trades away, and who should skip it. If we only told you the first part, this would be an ad.

[Text - Section: why it matters]
{{ the problem this system was built to solve, in one honest paragraph — what customers kept asking for that the existing range didn't cover }}

Strengths: {{ 2–3 real strengths — base behaviour, hairline, lifespan, routine }}
Trade-offs: {{ the honest cost — lifespan, fragility, routine, price }}
Skip it if: {{ who this is genuinely wrong for }}

[Column - Image and text]
{{ image + text: the base construction close up — what you're looking at and why it's built that way }}

[Product - 3-up grid]
{{ dynamic: the featured system + the two closest alternatives }}

[Comparison] (recommended)
{{ dynamic: featured system vs its two neighbours — base, lifespan, attachment, best for }}

[Testimonial] (recommended)
[PULL from Proof Bank: one consented quote from an early wearer of this system, if available]

[List - Trust strip] (recommended)
Built to your spec · 14-day inspection window · 3–4 week build · Skin-safe certified adhesives

